{"id":"40fee94342fc09ce","group":"16","path":"16/16-prop-markov.md","title":"prop-markov-eff","display":"prop-markov-eff","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-prop-markov","aliases":["16-prop-markov","Markov principle in Eff","16-pro--markov"],"display":"prop-markov-eff","depends_on":["[[16-prop-nno-eff]]","[[16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff]]","[[16-df-topos-5]]"],"source":"Lemma6.4.3 p.400 (PDF420); Proposition6.4.4 p.401 (PDF421)","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-prop-markov"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-prop-markov</span><span>Markov principle in Eff</span><span>16-pro--markov</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-markov-eff"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c7c40f40c78440c0\" href=\"?note=c7c40f40c78440c0\" title=\"16-prop-nno-eff\">16-prop-nno-eff</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"198e3b21cd4c6cd2\" href=\"?note=198e3b21cd4c6cd2\" title=\"16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff\">16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8cc0e0e038ae9b87\" href=\"?note=8cc0e0e038ae9b87\" title=\"16-df-topos-5\">16-df-topos-5</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Lemma6.4.3 p.400 (PDF420); Proposition6.4.4 p.401 (PDF421)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf N\">\\(\\mathbf N\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c7c40f40c78440c0\" href=\"?note=c7c40f40c78440c0\" title=\"16-prop-nno-eff\">16-prop-nno-eff</a> 的自然数PER对象；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}\\to\\mathbf{Eff}\">\\(F:\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}\\to\\mathbf{Eff}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"198e3b21cd4c6cd2\" href=\"?note=198e3b21cd4c6cd2\" title=\"16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff\">16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff</a>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(D=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_D(d)=\\{d\\}\">\\(E_D(d)=\\{d\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf2=F(D,E_D)\">\\(\\mathbf2=F(D,E_D)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_0:1\\rightarrowtail\\mathbf2\">\\(b_0:1\\rightarrowtail\\mathbf2\\)</span> 是元素0诱导的单态（其图关系在该嵌入中给出）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=\\mathbf2^{\\mathbf N}\">\\(B=\\mathbf2^{\\mathbf N}\\)</span> 为指数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ev}:B\\times\\mathbf N\\to\\mathbf2\">\\(\\operatorname{ev}:B\\times\\mathbf N\\to\\mathbf2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:B\\times\\mathbf N\\to B\">\\(q:B\\times\\mathbf N\\to B\\)</span> 为投影。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_q\">\\(\\Sigma_q\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow_B\">\\(\\Rightarrow_B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_B\">\\(\\bot_B\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8cc0e0e038ae9b87\" href=\"?note=8cc0e0e038ae9b87\" title=\"16-df-topos-5\">16-df-topos-5</a> 保证的子对象一阶纤维结构。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,A\">\\(P,A\\)</span> 由下文正式构造，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MP}_{\\mathbf{Eff}}\">\\(\\mathrm{MP}_{\\mathbf{Eff}}\\)</span> 是Markov有效性的无句法缩写。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nP&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ev}^*[b_0]\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathbf{Eff}}(B\\times\\mathbf N),\\\\\nA&amp;\\coloneqq\\Sigma_qP\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathbf{Eff}}(B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{MP}_{\\mathbf{Eff}}&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\bigl((A\\Rightarrow_B\\bot_B)\\Rightarrow_B\\bot_B\\bigr)\\le_B A,\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{MP}_{\\mathbf{Eff}}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nP&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ev}^*[b_0]\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathbf{Eff}}(B\\times\\mathbf N),\\\\\nA&amp;\\coloneqq\\Sigma_qP\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathbf{Eff}}(B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{MP}_{\\mathbf{Eff}}&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\bigl((A\\Rightarrow_B\\bot_B)\\Rightarrow_B\\bot_B\\bigr)\\le_B A,\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{MP}_{\\mathbf{Eff}}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>该子对象包含式精确表达内部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall f:\\mathbf N\\to\\mathbf2.\\ \\neg\\neg\\exists n.\\,f(n)=0\\Rightarrow\\exists n.\\,f(n)=0\">\\(\\forall f:\\mathbf N\\to\\mathbf2.\\ \\neg\\neg\\exists n.\\,f(n)=0\\Rightarrow\\exists n.\\,f(n)=0\\)</span>，没有用未定义的Eff⊨符号。取0或1只相差交换两位的递归自同构。</p>\n<p>Proposition6.4.4 p.401 (PDF421) 的证明已核对：由Lemma6.4.3 p.400 (PDF420)，指数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf N^{\\mathbf N}\">\\(\\mathbf N^{\\mathbf N}\\)</span> 可表示为全递归函数的assembly，每个函数的存在证据是其程序索引；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>限制到二值函数。给该索引e，从n=0开始依次计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e(n)\">\\(\\varphi_e(n)\\)</span>，找到0时输出该n及其存在证明。若双重否定前提有实现元，则必有此n，最小化搜索终止；若前提为空则该蕴涵无需输出。因此一个固定部分递归算法一致实现此蕴涵，故得到上述包含。算法使用函数的索引，而非从没有计算信息的双重否定证明中提取界限。它证明的是Markov原理，未推出排中律。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-prop-nno-eff","status":"resolved","id":"c7c40f40c78440c0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-prop-nno-eff]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-omeg